{"id":1130503,"name":"맥퀸·심문 III","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"맥퀸·심문 III","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1130503]}],"trial":{"trial_id":130503,"stage":"3단계","unlock_time":"2023-01-17 14:00:00","diary1":"맥퀸의 의도적인 선동에 미술관 안의 M 수치는 계속 상승했다. 이 혼란을 막을 방법을 찾아야 한다. 필요하다면 강제적 수단을 사용해도 된다.","diary2":"맥퀸은 다시는 다른 화가에게 꿈을 포기하라 권유하지 않겠다고 시원하게 약속했지만 사후 조사 결과, 신성에 있는 맥퀸의 사무소가 영업을 완전히 중단한 것은 아니었다.\n　　맥퀸이 심문실을 떠날 때 남긴 마지막 말은 그녀 앞으로의 선택에 대한 대답이었던 듯하다.\n　　속물적이고 혼란스러우며 변덕스러운 것… 이런 것이야말로 맥퀸이며 신성 상류사회의 모든 연결고리다.","evidence":[{"ID":260303,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260304,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":3,"dialogue_id":230503012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":3,"dialogue_id":230503017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230503022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialo